When you're an acid blob, or something else slightly blobby, you can ooze
under doors, instead of opening them.
When you're an acid blob, or a cockatrice, or anything w/out eyes,
and you run into Medusa: "You look upon Medusa. So what?"
When you're inside an altar room of a priest you just killed,interesting
things happen:  I got the message "You enter an untended sanctuary.  You
feel <message you get when entereing opposing's alignment's sanctuary.>"
I wandered around for a bit,  kept getting messages like: You feel you
are being watched, or: a shiver runs down your spine.  FInally, a ghost
 appeared out of nowhere and attacked me.
Later, on two separate levels, I looked at a map, and there were several
rooms that were almost filled with pools.  These pools had molds and fungi
in the spaces between them, and I got messages like: You smell swamp gas!
and You hear mosquitoes! Any idea what it was?


